penlight-no-brain = You see nothing unusual through the pupil.
penlight-brain-dead = Pupils are fixed and dilated. No brain activity detected.
penlight-brain-severe = Pupils are sluggish and barely responsive. Severe brain damage.
penlight-brain-moderate = Pupil response is weak. Moderate brain damage.
penlight-brain-minor = Pupil response is slightly delayed. Minor brain damage.
penlight-brain-normal = Pupils react normally. Brain activity appears normal.
